      "id": "engine",
      "label": "ShortcutEngine 引擎",
      "kind": "business",
      "module": "engine",
      "subtitle": "输入路由 + 三相状态机 + 协作者 wiring",
      "facts": [
        "idle / armed / active 三相；KeyEventRouter 做纯路由",
        "EngineState 是 @MainActor @Observable 状态容器",
        "七个协作者：PanelSession、SearchSession、CatalogCoordinator、RowRunner、BindingEditor、LiveTestCoordinator、DiagnosticsReporter",
        "经 Core/Ports 协议展示 UI 与 HUD，依赖方向朝内"
      ],
      "overviewText": [
        "协调器而非上帝对象：行为委派协作者，决策下沉 Pure，状态集中在 EngineState。"
      ],
